# Data, models, logs (do not commit raw artifacts).
# Note: a one-time snapshot of data/results/smoke_test/ is committed to record
# the 2026-05-06 pipeline validation; the patterns below stop NEW experiment
# runs from polluting the repo. To explicitly track a future run, use
# `git add -f data/results/<run>/`.
data/raw/
data/processed/
data/results/**/*.jsonl
data/results/**/*.npy
data/results/**/*.npz
data/results/**/*.csv
data/results/**/*.json
data/results/**/vectors/
logs/
models/

